# Performance workflow (measure-first)

## Non-negotiables

- No speculative optimization without at least one artifact:
  - DevTools Performance profile
  - Sentry trace/profile link
  - bundle analyzer output (`.next/diagnostics/analyze/`)
  - Lighthouse report (when relevant)

## Pick the right playbook

- Interaction latency → `inp-investigation`
- Bundle/TTI regressions → `bundle-analysis`
- Server delays → `ttfb-audit`
- General perf debugging → `perf-investigation`

## Output standard

Every perf task must end with:

- **What was slow** (metric)
- **Why** (root cause)
- **What changed** (patch)
- **Proof** (artifact + delta)

